          "id": "34d109538c7f82f30d1f34a7a90c6e2e4560877d",
          "message": "feat(ci): sparq self-arm — arm review:pass PRs via enablePullRequestAutoMerge (registry#447) (#3633)\n\nNew .github/workflows/auto-arm.yml + scripts/auto-arm.py: on review:pass label\n(and a schedule backstop), arm non-draft sparq PRs via the explicit\nenablePullRequestAutoMerge GraphQL mutation with expectedHeadOid CAS (NOT\ngh pr merge --auto — the #334 direct-merge-on-clean finding). Skips\ntrust-surface / needs:user / security-ZK-MPC surfaces (decision-7 posture).\nRemoves the orchestrator-manual-arm dependency that stalls sparq when the\norchestrator is absent.\n\nAuthored headless by GPT-5.6 sol (codex, delegated account); host-verified\n(self-test + actionlint green).\n\nCo-authored-by: sparq-agent <sparq-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
